the movie begins with a family of three  who has been living inside a nuclear  bunker for 301 days the parents ray and  claire have always emphasized two key  rules to their daughter zoe to always  remain calm and never leave the shelter  sadly the world above them has been  deserted due to a strange viral outbreak  and now they are the only survivors left  although it has been 301 days since the  infection began the ground is still  extremely dangerous as the epidemic has  given birth to dangerous creatures known  as the breathers who kill any humans on  site  the scene shifts to 301 days ago when it  first began the family of three is  living in a peaceful neighborhood when  suddenly they notice their neighbors  start frantically packing to leave town  when asked what happened the neighbors  do not answer but swiftly drive away  instead it turns out that a highly  contagious viral epidemic has hit their  small town named kingsville scared of  getting infected the inhabitants leave  their homes and drive down the highway  to escape however they are stopped  midway by the cdc who declare the area  to be under quarantine as the people  step out of their cars a pair of fighter  jets drops multiple bombs nearby  attacking the scared citizens as they  run away in fear amidst the chaos ray  leads the family to a nearby elementary  school just as the fighter jets drop  another bomb nearby they find a hatch  leading to the shelter and enter it back  in the present zoe wakes up one night  after having a nightmare about the  breathers infiltrating their shelter the  mother quickly calms her down assuring  that she is safe as her dad ray is out  keeping watch to ease her concerns  claire takes zoey to meet rey who is  just returning from his watch shift rey  further assures her that she's safe and  allows her to climb a ladder leading to  the shelter's exit when zoe reaches the  top she discovers that the opening is  firmly locked with an array of secure  chains seeing this a paranoid zoe is  finally convinced and returns to her  parents as the family heads for the  shelter's pantry in there zoe alongside  claire conducts their morning ritual of  carving a line on the wall to signify a  new day after doing this zoe counts the  wall's markings and realizes that they  have spent a total of 301 days alone in  the shelter this realization saddens zoe  as she has no friends her age and is  tired of staying in the gloomy shelter a  few minutes later zoe sits to have  breakfast while claire scans the pantry  shelf for food however they soon  discover that the container is empty on  investigating claire finds that a rat  had entered the pantry and eaten through  most of the canned foods thus shortening  their already limited options the family  also discovers that the rat managed to  sneak into the shelter through an  opening other than the main barricaded  hatch they find a small air duct but ray  reassures zoe that the breathers  wouldn't be able to fit through that  duct left with very few alternatives and  no remaining peach cans the family  settles for a plate of beans for  breakfast he disappointed zoe sulks over  the beans and picks at her meal as she  refrains from eating weary due to their  situation zoe rants about the subpar  living conditions and complains about  being cooped up in the shelter rey  understands her and consoles his  distraught daughter as he explains the  importance of staying in the shelter to  hide from the breathers eventually zoe  sees reason and resumes eating after rey  cracks a joke to brighten the mood later  that night claire joins zoey in the  other room the duo plays monopoly but  zoey soon becomes disinterested and  bored of the game seeing this claire  hands zoe a periscope to view the ground  above if games are boring you little one  how about a peek at our inevitable  demise looking through the device zoe  sees the outside world but is  disappointed to find nothing but a  wasteland after the brief viewing zoe  returns to play monopoly with claire at  the dinner table while playing zoe spots  the rat munching on one of the cans and  silently alerts her mom eventually she  also calls a sleeping ray to the pantry  as the trio decides on how to kill the  beast after a long deliberation claire  kills the rat before it escapes but in  the process the rodent knocks over one  of the lamps which explodes causing an  overwhelming fire claire instantly  brings a cloth and tries to put out the  flames while rey heads for the pump to  get water once again the faulty pump  malfunctions causing ray to struggle  with the lever while claire screams at  him for help fortunately ray gets it to  work in time and together the duo puts  out the intense flames when the fire has  been fully quenched the family discovers  that the residual smoke has entered the  air vents and is escaping to the ground  above seeing this the family figures  that the breathers could see the ash on  the overhead ground and decides to head  to the surface to cover their tracks  after instructing zoe not to leave the  shelter the couple heads for the surface  to get rid of the residual ash while the  couple clears the ground zoe watches  them through the periscope right then  she sees a strange figure  lurking behind her parents and assumes  that it is a breather zoe screams to get  her parents attention further drawing  attention to them but the couple who are  a long distance away don't hear her  disregarding their instructions zoe  opens the hatch and exits the shelter as  she races to her parents to warn them of  the lurking creature outside zoe finds  no one and screams their names as she  wanders around searching for them  suddenly claire pops up behind zoe and  shuts her mouth to stop her incessant  screams when claire releases zoe the  little girl warns the couple of the  strange figure she saw behind them the  shapes that zoe saw turn out to be a  herd of deer  but the trio realizes that they must be  running away from something and so they  immediately sprint to the open hatch and  head for the shelter just as they enter  the underground facility the family  hears the loud footsteps of a breather  plodding along the ground overhead to  avoid being discovered they all remain  mute as they nervously listen to the  footsteps above just as they begin to  fade zoe's doll starts bugging out  making a ruckus after her pull string  accidentally gets caught on a nearby  pipe horrified by the doll sounds ray  swiftly grabs the toy and destroys it  just in case zoe needed a little more  trauma in her life to prevent it from  attracting the creature however it is  too late as the breather has heard the  doll and violently attacks the hatch to  access the underground shelter  one by one the chains are pulled from  their moorings and seeing this rand  claire climbed the ladder to wedge the  door shut for one terrifying moment it  is opened and skarsgard goes full  barbarian on the creature outside  afterwards they get the wedge in place  stopping the creature from breaking in  on hearing no further sounds clare and  ray climb down the ladder and reunite  with zoe as they all heave a sigh of  relief however this is short-lived as  the sounds on the roof intensify thus  revealing that more of the creatures  have arrived the family tries to get  another wedge for the hatch but before  they can react the breathers destroy it  as the heavy metal falls to the ground  seeing this the trio sprints to another  room in a desperate attempt to escape to  buy some time claire hauls a lamp at the  passageway causing another fire after  which she and ray use a shelf to further  obstruct the way after this they search  for an alternate exit and decide to use  the vent that the rat used previously  with rey's help claire passes through  the tight opening and emerges outside  reaching the overhead ground claire  scans the area and fortunately spots no  breathers claire quickly informs rey who  then also helps zoe through the vents  once mother and daughter have made it  through rey tries to climb as well but  can't seem to fit in a desperate moment  raid dislocates his shoulder and tries  to fit in however before he can make it  outside the breathers make it through  and attack the injured man pulling him  back into the shelter on looking down  claire and zoe are horrified to see a  splatter of blood and eventually assume  that rey is dead after taking a moment  to grieve him making an absolutely  idiotic amount of noise the duo sprints  through the dark roads and emerges on a  highway filled with a lineup of empty  cars right then a helicopter with a  bright headlight appears in the sky  seeing the chopper the duo runs in the  opposite direction however they don't  make it far before they're captured by a  fired net as they struggle to free  themselves from the net the breathers  appear from the shadows and surround the  door as they step into the light we  learned that the breathers are in fact  not monstrous creatures at all but  actually american soldiers wearing full  protective face masks in a flashback  scene 301 days ago we see claire into  the family right after the aerial attack  in the bunker claire finds a cut on her  hand and shows the rest of her family as  it turns black signifying that she is  infected seeing this the family realizes  that the virus is airborne and has now  infected the entire town back in the  present the armed men ask the duo to  calm down as they whip out a syringe to  test them for the virus as the soldiers  extract their blood they discover that  the pair are indeed infected learning  this the army men surround them with  guns and prepare to fire however before  they pull the trigger  rey who is transformed into a  vampire-like creature with black veins  and bloodshot eyes attacks the soldiers  exhibiting superhuman strength he  manages to kill a handful of them but  ultimately gets taken down by the others  who riddle him with bullets here we get  a shocking revelation of the true nature  of the virus the family are actually the  infected ones while the breathers are  just normal people um so how did they  yank the hatch so hard that the chains  broke the virus though contagious is not  lethal as the infected can live an  almost normal life so long as they do  not lose control then we discover why  rey and claire insisted on the rule to  always stay calm at the start of the  movie apparently the infected can lose  control of their emotions and become  monsters however if they stay calm they  remain like normal humans sadly this  does not rule out the fact that they are  infected and therefore dangerous and the  army wants to kill them all when the  soldiers are done with rey they look  back at the net only to discover that  claire and zoe have escaped a few  moments later zoe hides in a car while  claire transforms into the same  vampire-like state and easily knocks out  three of the four remaining soldiers  however she is shot and injured by the  last surviving soldier just as the armed  man is about to take the final shot a  transformed zoe jumps at him and removes  his face mask exposing him to the virus  zoe tries killing the soldier but is  ultimately stopped by claire don't give  him a quick death dear let him live a  cursed existence too eventually the duo  leaves the man and walks down the  highway as they search for rey a few  meters away the duo finds a dying ray  lying on the floor and tearfully say  their final goodbyes shortly after  claire and zoe spot another chopper  approaching so they run into an  underground tunnel hidden under a pile  of destroyed wood as the pair heads  inside the tunnel they run into joey the  son of their next-door neighbors who  they last saw a year ago at the start of  the outbreak miles and miles away from  here the little boy leads them to a  hatch and on opening it reveals a sewer  system below inside claire and zoey  discovered that there are other infected  survivors who have been living in the  kingsville sewers for months seeing this  mother and daughter are relieved to have  finally found other people like them  zoey climbs down the hatch to join the  welcoming group with claire following  shortly after the movie ends as claire  stares into the sun with bloodshot eyes  before ultimately shutting the hatch  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

